@startuml UV坐标映射
skinparam backgroundColor #FEFEFE
skinparam rectangleBackgroundColor #E3F2FD
skinparam rectangleBorderColor #1565C0
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FFF9C4
skinparam noteBorderColor #F57F17
skinparam defaultFontName Microsoft YaHei

title UV坐标映射原理

rectangle "3D立方体顶点" as Cube {
    node "顶点1" as V1 {
        label "pos: (-1, -1, -1)\nnormal: (0, 0, -1)\n<b>tex: (0, 1)</b>"
    }
    
    node "顶点2" as V2 {
        label "pos: (-1, +1, -1)\nnormal: (0, 0, -1)\n<b>tex: (0, 0)</b>"
    }
    
    node "顶点3" as V3 {
        label "pos: (+1, +1, -1)\nnormal: (0, 0, -1)\n<b>tex: (1, 0)</b>"
    }
    
    node "顶点4" as V4 {
        label "pos: (+1, -1, -1)\nnormal: (0, 0, -1)\n<b>tex: (1, 1)</b>"
    }
}

note top of Cube
    <b>立方体前表面（一个面）</b>
    UV坐标定义纹理如何映射到表面
end note

rectangle "纹理空间" as TexSpace {
    rectangle "纹理图像" as TexImage {
        label "<b>(0,0)      (1,0)</b>\n  ┌────────────┐\n  │            │\n  │  WoodCrate │\n  │            │\n  └────────────┘\n<b>(0,1)      (1,1)</b>"
    }
}

note top of TexSpace
    <b>纹理坐标系</b>
    U轴: 左(0) → 右(1)
    V轴: 上(0) → 下(1)
    与DirectX屏幕坐标一致
end note

V2 -down-> TexImage : UV(0,0)\n左上角
V3 -down-> TexImage : UV(1,0)\n右上角
V1 -down-> TexImage : UV(0,1)\n左下角
V4 -down-> TexImage : UV(1,1)\n右下角

note bottom of TexImage
    <b>插值过程</b>
    三角形内部的UV坐标通过
    顶点UV坐标线性插值得到
    
    像素着色器接收插值后的UV
    用于纹理采样
end note

rectangle "光栅化插值" as Raster {
    label "<b>三角形内部UV插值</b>\nUV_pixel = \n  u1 * UV_v1 + \n  u2 * UV_v2 + \n  u3 * UV_v3\n\nu1 + u2 + u3 = 1\n(重心坐标)"
}

Cube --> Raster : 顶点UV
Raster --> TexImage : 插值后的UV

note bottom of Raster
    <b>透视校正插值</b>
    考虑深度进行正确插值
    防止纹理扭曲
end note

@enduml
